# SA6 red evidence — PR #276 `test (24, 4)` root-lock double-owner race (head 334494d)

Evidence files (all captured on production `acquireRootLock` from
`apps/yjs-server/src/lifecycle.ts` at HEAD 334494d, executed by real forked worker
processes via `test/fixtures/root-lock-worker.ts`, Node v24.13.0):

